*======================================================================*
* GPSS DATA PROCESSING UTILITY - PROCESSOR LOGIC                  *
*======================================================================*

BLOCKSIZE 80

title  DATA_PROCESSOR_MODULE

*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
* 1. PROCESSING STAGE                                              *
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
* Transactions arrive from Parser (simulated by initial generate)  *
   GENERATE    -1,,100       * 100 records to process

* Check-in to Processing Facility                                *
   ENTER       PROCESS_F

* Core Transformation Logic                                      *
* Multiply attribute 2 by 1.1 (simulate tax/interest calculation)*
   MULTIPLY    2, 1.1

* Add a processing timestamp (simulated current time)            *
   ASSIGN      3, SIMTIME

* Check-out from Facility                                      *
   LEAVE       PROCESS_F

* Send to Reporter                                             *
   QUEUE       REPORT_Q
   ENTER       REPORTER_F
   LEAVE       REPORTER_F

*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
* 2. FACILITIES & QUEUES                                         *
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
   FACILITY    PROCESS_F
   QUEUE       REPORT_Q
   FACILITY    REPORTER_F

   START       1

END
